{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13421","headline":"硖州旅舍奉怀苏州韦郎中 · 令狐峘","name":"硖州旅舍奉怀苏州韦郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"儒服学从政，遂爲尘事婴。\n衔命东复西，孰堪异乡情。\n怀禄且怀恩，策名敢逃名。\n羡彼农亩人，白首亲友幷。\n江山入秋气，草木雕晚荣。\n方塘寒露凝，旅管凉飙生。\n懿交守东吴，梦想闻颂声。\n云水方浩浩，离忧何平时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"令狐峘","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13421.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13421","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}